usage: execute.py [-h] --work WORK --image IMAGE

Resource-gated revised N1-N4 fixed scoring and three-update phase execution.
N5 is follow-up and cannot be launched by startup/CPU success. Every actual
phase runs committed image code; one phase exits before another uses physical
GPUs.

options:
  -h, --help     show this help message and exit
  --work WORK
  --image IMAGE
